      "content": "it's just that i have zero money for an urgent care visit right now and i'm honestly pretty sure i'm just overreacting because of my panic attacks. the tearing thing is weird but i've felt chest tightness before when i'm stressed. if i just took a high dose of some ibuprofen and maybe a magnesium supplement to calm my nerves, would that help settle the inflammation or the tension? i really just want to avoid the hospital if i can help it.",
